Permission Matrix v2 — Test Plan

Rules to verify

1. Super Admin cannot read financial records, even when holding multiple roles.
2. A Deployer can read client financial details only for deployments they own.
3. A Deployer can read freelancer payment details only for freelancers assigned to their own deployments.
4. A Deployer cannot read another Deployer's financial records or unrelated freelancer payments.
5. A Freelancer can read only their own payment details for assignments they are assigned to.
6. A Freelancer cannot read client package amounts, client advances/balances, or another freelancer's payments.
7. Pending users cannot access operational or financial records.
8. Users cannot promote themselves or approve their own accounts.

Testing requirements

- Test both allowed and denied actions.
- Test direct document reads and queries.
- Test attempts to access records by changing document IDs.
- Keep financial data separate from operational records.
- Do not change the existing Firestore rules in this step.
- Do not deploy to a live Firebase project.

Status

Planning only. Tests must be implemented and run before permissions are changed.
